{"seq":3,"slug":"variant-axis-sku-matrix-model","title":"变体轴与 SKU 矩阵建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/pim-product-taxonomy-attribute-data-governance/taxonomy-attribute-variant-model/variant-axis-sku-matrix-model","wordCount":2487,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"变体轴与-sku-矩阵建模\">变体轴与 SKU 矩阵建模</h1><p>一件「同一款 T 恤」在系统里到底是 1 条记录还是 72 条记录？答案取决于**变体轴（variant axis）**的选择：颜色、尺码两个轴各自有 6 个取值，笛卡尔积就是 36 个可售单元。跨境场景下这个问题被进一步放大——同一个 SPU 要在 Shopify 的 variant、Amazon 的 child ASIN、Google Merchant Center 的 <code>item_group_id</code> 子项之间保持一一对应，任何一个轴的取值在某个渠道被合并或裁剪，整个矩阵就错位。本文讨论轴的识别、矩阵的稠密/稀疏建模、SKU 标识生成和轴变更的迁移治理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-轴-选项值-变体组与可售单元\">核心概念：轴、选项值、变体组与可售单元</h2><p>PIM 语境里「变体」至少牵扯四个不同粒度的对象，混为一谈是变体数据散架的根因。</p>\n<p><strong>变体组（product group / SPU）</strong>：共享标题、描述、品牌、品类归属等非变化数据的逻辑商品。schema.org 用 <code>ProductGroup</code> 显式建模这个概念，它持有组级共享数据，并「本身不直接售卖」（schema.org/ProductGroup）。</p>\n<p><strong>变体轴（variant axis）</strong>：决定可售单元分裂的维度，本质是「受控属性中被标记为轴的那几个」。它必须是有限枚举、值域受治理的属性——<code>color</code>、<code>size</code>、<code>capacity</code> 可以作轴；<code>weight</code>、<code>battery_life</code> 这种连续量或自由文本不能作轴，只能作变体级规格。</p>\n<p><strong>变体（variant / SKU 单元）</strong>：轴上取值的一个具体组合，如 <code>{color=黑, size=M}</code>，携带自己的价格、库存、条码和图片。</p>\n<p><strong>选项（option）与选项值（option value）</strong>：轴的平台侧叫法。Shopify 2025 年把选项模型统一为<strong>带稳定 ID 的 Option / OptionValue 对象</strong>，变体通过 ID 引用选项值而不是靠字符串匹配——这一改动直接消灭了「同一颜色命中两条 variant」的历史顽疾（Shopify Developers, Product model）。</p>\n<p>关键约束：<strong>轴是强契约，非轴属性是弱数据</strong>。轴变更会重建整个矩阵并断掉外部渠道映射，非轴属性变更只改一行规格。判断一个属性该不该作轴，看它是否同时满足三条：有限枚举、买家会据此做购买决策、需要独立库存与价格。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对象</th>\n<th>粒度</th>\n<th>是否独立售卖</th>\n<th>是否携带库存/价格</th>\n<th>稳定标识</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>变体组 SPU</td>\n<td>一组</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td><code>productGroupID</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轴 / 选项</td>\n<td>维度定义</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>Option ID</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>选项值</td>\n<td>维度取值</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>OptionValue ID</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变体 / SKU 单元</td>\n<td>具体组合</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>SKU / GTIN / ASIN</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"轴组合与矩阵-从笛卡尔积到稀疏矩阵\">轴组合与矩阵：从笛卡尔积到稀疏矩阵</h2><p>如果轴集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_1, A_2, \\dots, A_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，各自取值数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，那么组合空间的理论大小就是各轴基数的乘积：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|M| = \\prod_{i=1}^{k} n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1138em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>3 个轴、各 5 个取值 = 125 个候选单元。但真实世界<strong>极少是满矩阵</strong>：<code>{尺码=XXS, 颜色=军绿}</code> 可能根本不生产，<code>{容量=2TB, 接口=USB-A}</code> 可能下架多年。把候选空间直接物化成稠密矩阵，后果是库存系统里躺着大量「永远为 0 的 SKU」，污染补货预测、广告投放和渠道 feeds。</p>\n<p>正确做法是<strong>候选空间与有效组合分离</strong>：枚举出理论组合，再用业务规则过滤成有效组合集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V \\subseteq M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>，只物化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>。填充率</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = \\frac{|V|}{|M|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>是变体数据健康度的核心指标。跨境服装类 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 常在 0.4–0.7（断码断色），消费电子接近 1.0。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho &lt; 0.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span></span></span></span></span> 说明轴选多了或选项值该合并，应触发治理工单而不是硬造 SKU。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[SPU: 男士T恤] --&gt; B[轴1: color&lt;br/&gt;黑/白/军绿/藏青]&#10;  A --&gt; C[轴2: size&lt;br/&gt;S/M/L/XL/XXL/XXXL]&#10;  B --&gt; D{笛卡尔积&lt;br/&gt;4 x 6 = 24}&#10;  C --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E[有效组合 V&lt;br/&gt;ρ = 18/24 = 0.75]&#10;  E --&gt; F[SKU: TEE-BLK-M&lt;br/&gt;GTIN + 价格 + 库存]&#10;  E --&gt; G[SKU: TEE-NVY-XL&lt;br/&gt;GTIN + 价格 + 库存]&#10;  D -.-&gt; H[无效组合&lt;br/&gt;军绿 XXXL 不生产&lt;br/&gt;不生成SKU]\">graph TD\n  A[SPU: 男士T恤] --&gt; B[轴1: color&lt;br/&gt;黑/白/军绿/藏青]\n  A --&gt; C[轴2: size&lt;br/&gt;S/M/L/XL/XXL/XXXL]\n  B --&gt; D{笛卡尔积&lt;br/&gt;4 x 6 = 24}\n  C --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E[有效组合 V&lt;br/&gt;ρ = 18/24 = 0.75]\n  E --&gt; F[SKU: TEE-BLK-M&lt;br/&gt;GTIN + 价格 + 库存]\n  E --&gt; G[SKU: TEE-NVY-XL&lt;br/&gt;GTIN + 价格 + 库存]\n  D -.-&gt; H[无效组合&lt;br/&gt;军绿 XXXL 不生产&lt;br/&gt;不生成SKU]</pre><p>矩阵的存储有两种正交选择：<strong>按组合物化</strong>（每个有效组合一行 variant，选项值通过 join 表关联）还是<strong>按轴定义 + 组合表达</strong>。主流 PIM 选前者——因为库存和价格天然是「按可售单元」的事实，物化后与仓储、订单、发票的粒度一致，无需在订单行上再推导。稀疏性由「只写 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>」保证，不靠稀疏矩阵数据结构。</p>\n<p>组合枚举在工程上要注意：不要在前端循环里现算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 层嵌套。用<strong>递归展开 + 剪枝</strong>——每层先按业务规则裁掉不可用值，再进下一层，可把 100 万级候选空间的评估降到秒级。轴基数超过 4 或乘积超过平台上限时，必须提前拆分 SPU，见下节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"轴数量上限与平台约束\">轴数量上限与平台约束</h2><p>每个平台对轴数和变体数都有硬上限，超限不是「存不下」而是<strong>直接被拒绝或静默截断</strong>，这是跨境铺货最常见的翻车点。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>轴数上限</th>\n<th>变体数上限</th>\n<th>标识字段</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Shopify</td>\n<td>选项 3 个（2025 后支持更多，超 3 个仍受限）</td>\n<td>单商品 100 个（Plus/部分计划可至 2048）</td>\n<td><code>productVariants</code> / <code>variant.id</code></td>\n<td>Shopify Developers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amazon</td>\n<td>由类目模板定义（多为 2–3）</td>\n<td>由类目决定，常见父子绑定上限</td>\n<td><code>parent_sku</code> + <code>child</code> 关系</td>\n<td>Amazon Seller Central</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Google Merchant Center</td>\n<td>变化属性集固定（color/size/material/pattern 等）</td>\n<td>无显式计数上限，按 <code>item_group_id</code> 归组</td>\n<td><code>item_group_id</code> + <code>color</code>/<code>size</code></td>\n<td>Google Merchant Center 帮助中心</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>schema.org</td>\n<td>无硬限（<code>variesBy</code> 可声明多个）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td><code>ProductGroup</code> / <code>hasVariant</code> / <code>isVariantOf</code></td>\n<td>schema.org/ProductGroup</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GS1 GTIN</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>每个可售单元一个 GTIN</td>\n<td>GTIN-8/12/13/14</td>\n<td>gs1.org</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两个强制设计结论由此推出。</p>\n<p>其一，<strong>轴数要以最严渠道为准</strong>。若 Amazon 某类目只认 2 个轴，而内部模型设计了 3 个，第三轴必须在铺货时被折叠成标题后缀或独立 SPU，而不是硬塞。折叠规则必须在 PIM 里有显式字段，不能靠运营记性。</p>\n<p>其二，<strong>变体数要按上限做 SPU 切分</strong>。24 个组合远低于 100，安全；但「手机壳 × 200 机型 × 8 颜色 = 1600」必须拆成按机型的多个 SPU，否则 Shopify 直接截断到 100，剩 1500 个默默丢失。切分阈值建议设在平台上限的 70%（如 70 个）留出运营期新增颜色的余量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"矩阵建模的数据结构与-sku-生成\">矩阵建模的数据结构与 SKU 生成</h2><p>推荐的最小可辩护 schema 是四张表：<code>product_group</code>（SPU）、<code>variant_axis</code>（轴定义）、<code>axis_value</code>（选项值，带稳定 ID 与排序）、<code>variant</code>（有效组合），外加一张 <code>variant_axis_value</code> 关联表实现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 的组合表达。<code>variant</code> 上唯一约束应为 <code>(product_group_id, sorted_axis_value_ids)</code> 的规范化哈希，从数据库层杜绝「同组合两条 SKU」。</p>\n<p>SKU 编码要<strong>人可读且可解析</strong>，但绝不把价格、库存、渠道编进去（它们会变）。常见模式是 <code>前缀-轴值短码</code> 拼接，如 <code>TEE-BLK-M</code>。风险是短码冲突与截断，所以必须配一个<strong>不可解析的内部主键</strong>（UUID 或雪花 ID）作真相源，SKU 码只作外部引用。一个副作用是轴序变化会改变 SKU 码——因此轴序必须冻结，且 SKU 生成时要按固定的 <code>axis_order</code> 字段排序，而非按用户录入顺序。</p>\n<p>条码层面，若要做零售/商超渠道，每个可售单元需要一个 GS1 分配的 GTIN。GTIN-13 的校验位算法（模 10 加权）必须在入库时校验，否则 Amazon 会以「invalid UPC」拒收。校验位计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>奇数位和</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>偶数位和</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c = (10 - ((3 \\cdot \\text{奇数位和} + \\text{偶数位和}) \\bmod 10)) \\bmod 10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">((</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">奇数位和</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">偶数位和</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>没有 GTIN 时，Amazon 侧可用 ASIN（平台分配）或 FNSKU（FBA 标签），但 PIM 里仍应保留一个自有 SKU 作为跨渠道锚点——ASIN 是渠道资产，商品下架后不可复用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[录入轴定义&lt;br/&gt;color=4值, size=6值] --&gt; B[递归枚举候选组合&lt;br/&gt;剪枝无效值]&#10;  B --&gt; C[应用业务规则&lt;br/&gt;得到有效组合 V]&#10;  C --&gt; D[生成 variant 行&lt;br/&gt;+ 规范化唯一键]&#10;  D --&gt; E[生成 SKU 码&lt;br/&gt;按冻结 axis_order]&#10;  D --&gt; F[校验/分配 GTIN&lt;br/&gt;模10校验位]&#10;  E --&gt; G[推送到渠道&lt;br/&gt;Shopify/Amazon/GMC]&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H{渠道是否接受?}&#10;  H --&gt;|超上限| I[回退: 拆SPU或折叠轴]&#10;  H --&gt;|接受| J[渠道ID回写&lt;br/&gt;variant_id/ASIN/item_group_id]\">flowchart TD\n  A[录入轴定义&lt;br/&gt;color=4值, size=6值] --&gt; B[递归枚举候选组合&lt;br/&gt;剪枝无效值]\n  B --&gt; C[应用业务规则&lt;br/&gt;得到有效组合 V]\n  C --&gt; D[生成 variant 行&lt;br/&gt;+ 规范化唯一键]\n  D --&gt; E[生成 SKU 码&lt;br/&gt;按冻结 axis_order]\n  D --&gt; F[校验/分配 GTIN&lt;br/&gt;模10校验位]\n  E --&gt; G[推送到渠道&lt;br/&gt;Shopify/Amazon/GMC]\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H{渠道是否接受?}\n  H --&gt;|超上限| I[回退: 拆SPU或折叠轴]\n  H --&gt;|接受| J[渠道ID回写&lt;br/&gt;variant_id/ASIN/item_group_id]</pre><h2 id=\"轴变更与矩阵迁移的治理\">轴变更与矩阵迁移的治理</h2><p>变体数据最难的不是建矩阵，而是<strong>改矩阵</strong>。轴相关变更分三档，风险递进。</p>\n<p><strong>选项值级</strong>（新增颜色、下架尺码）：低风险。新增只往 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 里加行；下架应打状态位而非删除，因为历史订单、发票、退货单还引用着旧 SKU。</p>\n<p><strong>轴级</strong>（给已有 SPU 加/删一个轴）：高风险，等价于重建整个矩阵。删轴要把两个变体合并成一个，必须定义<strong>冲突消解规则</strong>——价格取哪个、库存相加还是取一、图片保留哪张。合并后旧 SKU 需进入重定向表，否则渠道侧的外链、收藏、广告会 404。</p>\n<p><strong>轴语义级</strong>（把 <code>size</code> 从「S/M/L」改成数字码、把自由文本颜色改受控词表）：最高风险，往往触发全量重新映射和 GTIN 重发。这类变更必须走版本化流程，保留旧值域与映射表，并按批次灰度迁移。</p>\n<p>治理抓手是三条硬约束：<strong>轴定义冻结后变更需审批</strong>；<strong>每个轴变更生成迁移工单，包含旧值→新值映射与回滚脚本</strong>；<strong>变更后重跑渠道一致性校验</strong>，核对各渠道的 variant 数与内部 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|V|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 是否一致。跨境场景还要叠加渠道侧的保留策略——Amazon 父子关系在删除 child 后有一段时间不可复用，删除操作应优先「下架」而非「销毁」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>变体轴与 SKU 矩阵建模的本质，是把「哪些属性会分裂出可售单元」这一业务判断，翻译成一组强约束的数据契约，并在多个渠道的硬上限之间求可行解。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>分清四层对象：变体组 SPU、轴、选项值、变体单元；轴是硬契约，非轴属性是软数据。</li>\n<li>候选空间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∏</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|M| = \\prod n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与有效组合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 必须分离；填充率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = |V|/|M|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\">∣/∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 是健康度指标，过低说明轴选多了。</li>\n<li>轴数与变体数受各平台硬上限约束（Shopify 单商品 100 变体、Amazon 类目定轴），必须以最严渠道为准，按上限的 70% 预切 SPU。</li>\n<li>SKU 码人可读但不可解析为真相源，轴序必须冻结；GTIN 需通过模 10 校验位检验。</li>\n<li>轴变更分选项值级/轴级/轴语义级三档治理，删轴必须定义冲突消解与重定向，删除优先于销毁。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>同章上一篇 <a href=\"category-taxonomy-hierarchy-model\">品类分类体系与分类树建模</a> 讲了「这是什么」的受控词表如何组织，本文的轴与选项值正是挂在那棵树上、按节点契约声明的属性特例。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"变体轴与 SKU 矩阵建模","id":"变体轴与-sku-矩阵建模"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：轴、选项值、变体组与可售单元","id":"核心概念-轴-选项值-变体组与可售单元"},{"level":2,"text":"轴组合与矩阵：从笛卡尔积到稀疏矩阵","id":"轴组合与矩阵-从笛卡尔积到稀疏矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"轴数量上限与平台约束","id":"轴数量上限与平台约束"},{"level":2,"text":"矩阵建模的数据结构与 SKU 生成","id":"矩阵建模的数据结构与-sku-生成"},{"level":2,"text":"轴变更与矩阵迁移的治理","id":"轴变更与矩阵迁移的治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"属性模型、属性字典与度量单位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/pim-product-taxonomy-attribute-data-governance/taxonomy-attribute-variant-model/attribute-model-dictionary-units"},"next":{"title":"商品数据质量规则与内容校验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/pim-product-taxonomy-attribute-data-governance/data-quality-onboarding-stewardship/data-quality-rules-validation"}}